This repository holds icloud-session (session/, sessiond/), icloud-notes
(notes/, and its sync engine icloud-notes-sync in notes-sync/),
icloud-photos (photos/), icloud-findmy (findmy/), icloud-reminders
(reminders/) and icloud-drive (drive/). The third-party credits below
apply to the parts named; everything else is the author's own work.

