reminders/ (icloud-reminders): omui, with Strata and Lucide
============================================================================

The Reminders window (icloud-reminders-app) takes its look, its icons and
its widgets from omui (https://github.com/ferdousbhai/omui, MIT, by the
author of this repository), a git dependency pinned by `rev` in Cargo.toml.
Through it the binary holds code adapted from Strata and the Lucide icons.

omui's theme code, empty GTK theme resource, hidden title bar and visual
